<section class="lavka-media-help" aria-labelledby="lm-help-title"><h2 id="lm-help-title"><?php echo esc_html__('How to work with product images', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></h2><ol class="lm-steps"><li><strong><?php echo esc_html__('Find the products', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></strong><p><?php echo esc_html__('Use the missing-images report for current product coverage and the failed-links report for synchronization errors.', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></p></li><li><strong><?php echo esc_html__('Save the report', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></strong><p><?php echo esc_html__('Set the filters and export XLSX before making corrections. Keep this starting snapshot.', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></p></li><li><strong><?php echo esc_html__('Preview the correction', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></strong><p><?php echo esc_html__('Open the suggested image. Check the exact product, colour and size, then preview the Folio correction before confirming.', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></p></li><li><strong><?php echo esc_html__('Update the storefront', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></strong><p><?php echo esc_html__('Run the corrected-product queue and inspect the storefront. Failed items remain queued for investigation.', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></p></li></ol><details><summary><?php echo esc_html__('Before confirming a correction', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></summary><p><?php echo esc_html__('Do not confirm an ambiguous match or an image that cannot be opened. The failed-links log is historical and may retain resolved errors. Judge the current state using the product page and entries after the latest synchronization.', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php echo esc_html__('If the operation was interrupted', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></summary><p><?php echo esc_html__('Keep the XLSX report and the corrected-product queue. After an unknown outcome, ask the administrator to check the actual result before retrying. New source files belong in the batch uploader.', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></p></details><nav class="lm-links" aria-label="<?php echo esc_html__('Image workflow navigation', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?>"><a class="button" href="#lts_media_missing_report"><?php echo esc_html__('Products without images', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></a><a class="button" href="#lts_media_mismatch_report"><?php echo esc_html__('Review failed links', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></a><a class="button" href="#lts_media_repair_queue"><?php echo esc_html__('Corrected-product queue', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></a><a class="button button-primary" href="<?php echo esc_url(admin_url('upload.php?page=lavka-product-media-upload')); ?>"><?php echo esc_html__('Upload new product images', 'lavka-total-sync'); ?></a></nav></section>
